        "original_id": "3de9a102-f3e9-5340-ade3-83988b838b47",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Spanky, DJ Pierre, Herb J, George McNamara, Paul Woolford, Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay, ASC, xxxy, Appleblim, Al Tourettes\n- Groups/Companies: Phuture, Halocyan Records\n- Places: Chicago, Los Angeles, United Kingdom, continental Europe\n- Genres/Topics: acid house, rave, electronic music, techno\n\nFacts:\n- Phuture was founded in 1985 as an American acid-house group of electronic musicians based in Chicago.\n- Phuture was founded by Spanky, DJ Pierre, and Herb J.\n- Acid house spread to the United Kingdom and continental Europe, where DJs played it in the acid house scene and later in the rave scene.\n- Halocyan Records is based in Los Angeles, California.\n- Halocyan Records has released music by DJ Pierre of the Chicago-based acid-house group Phuture, Paul Woolford, techno pioneer Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay as Sistol, ASC, xxxy, Appleblim and Al Tourettes, and Extrawelt.\n- George McNamara was born in Chicago.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "d223efca-c3d2-56a2-b688-669155c5802d",
        "text": "Page: Phuture. Sentence: Phuture is an American, Chicago-based acid-house group of electronic musicians, founded in 1985 by Spanky, DJ Pierre and Herb J.\nPage: Acid house. Sentence: Acid house spread to the United Kingdom and continental Europe, where it was played by DJs in the acid house and later rave scenes.\nPage: Halocyan Records. Sentence: Based in Los Angeles, CA, the label has released music by artists such as DJ Pierre of Chicago-based acid house group Phuture, Paul Woolford, techno pioneer Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay (as Sistol), ASC, xxxy, Appleblim & Al Tourettes, Extrawelt and many more.\nPage: George McNamara (baseball). Sentence: He was born in Chicago.",
